  "important_distinctions": [
    "ToLower/ToUpper and lowercase variants are both installed.",
    "Legacy Trim/Replace signatures are not interchangeable with pipeline-first lowercase variants.",
    "trunc/substr bind Sprig byte-oriented functions, not same-named rune-oriented helpers elsewhere in fmt.go.",
    "duration binds Loki conversion, not Sprig duration formatter.",
    "fromJson returns arbitrary JSON shape rather than labels-only scalar data.",
    "now reads clock; __timestamp__ reads entry time."
  ]
